  {
   "id": "overall_acc",
   "type": "logic_python",
   "position": {
    "x": 3180,
    "y": 2560
   },
   "style": {},
   "data": {
    "label": "Python Node",
    "userLabel": "Overall Accuracy",
    "params": {
     "code": "// Overall Accuracy — pixel-classification accuracy of pred vs ground truth.\n//   a = predicted water mask (0/255)\n//   b = truth mask (GT water, 0/255)\n//   c = domain mask (opt) — restrict evaluation to this footprint (e.g. river corridor)\n// OA = (TP + TN) / (TP + TN + FP + FN). Water is rare, so OA is dominated by the\n// background (a mask that predicts \"no water\" everywhere already scores very high).\n// Balanced accuracy = mean(recall_water, recall_land) is reported alongside as the\n// imbalance-robust companion; F1/IoU live in the dedicated metrics node.\nconst bits = (m) => {\n  const d = m.data, ch = m.channels(), n = m.rows * m.cols, o = new Uint8Array(n);\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) o[i] = d[i * ch] > 127 ? 1 : 0;\n  return { v: o, w: m.cols, h: m.rows };\n};\n\nconst P = bits(a), T = bits(b);\nconst D = typeof c !== 'undefined' && c ? bits(c) : null;\n\n// Defensive crop to common shape (GT is aligned, but never assume).\nconst h = Math.min(P.h, T.h), w = Math.min(P.w, T.w);\nconst at = (m, x, y) => m.v[y * m.w + x];\n\nlet TP = 0, TN = 0, FP = 0, FN = 0, n = 0, restricted = false;\nfor (let y = 0; y < h; y++) {\n  for (let x = 0; x < w; x++) {\n    if (D) { if (!at(D, x, y)) { restricted = true; continue; } }\n    const p = at(P, x, y), t = at(T, x, y);\n    n++;\n    if (p && t) TP++; else if (!p && !t) TN++; else if (p && !t) FP++; else FN++;\n  }\n}\nif (n === 0) throw new Error('empty evaluation domain');\n\nconst oa = (TP + TN) / n;\nconst tpr = (TP + FN) ? TP / (TP + FN) : NaN;   // recall on water\nconst tnr = (TN + FP) ? TN / (TN + FP) : NaN;   // recall on land\nconst finite = [tpr, tnr].filter(Number.isFinite);\nconst bacc = finite.length ? finite.reduce((s, v) => s + v, 0) / finite.length : NaN;\nconst r4 = (v) => Number.isFinite(v) ? Math.round(v * 1e4) / 1e4 : null;\n\nout_accuracy = oa;\nout_stats = {\n  overall_accuracy: r4(oa),\n  balanced_accuracy: r4(bacc),\n  recall_water: r4(tpr),\n  recall_land: r4(tnr),\n  TP, TN, FP, FN,\n  n_pixels: n,\n  domain_restricted: restricted,\n};\n",
     "color_index": 3,
     "node_note": "Overall pixel accuracy OA=(TP+TN)/N de pred vs GT. a=pred(seuil avance), b=GT(landcover), c=domaine(opt, corr_dilate). Balanced accuracy reportee car l'eau est rare (OA domine par le fond). Comparable entre version MC et bypass."
    },
    "ports": [
     {
      "id": "mask__a",
      "color": "mask",
      "label": "a = pred"
     },
     {
      "id": "mask__b",
      "color": "mask",
      "label": "b = truth (GT)"
     },
     {
      "id": "mask__c",
      "color": "mask",
      "label": "c = domain (opt)"
     }
    ],
    "outPorts": [
     {
      "id": "scalar__out_accuracy",
      "color": "scalar",
      "label": "overall accuracy"
     },
     {
      "id": "any__out_stats",
      "color": "any",
      "label": "accuracy stats"
     }
    ]
   },
